invariant: INV-17
file: poly1305_ifma.c
catches: test/chacha-builds.sh
reason: poly1305_ifma_blocks returns without calling lanes_wipe_registers,
  which is avx512_wipe_registers,
  so the powers of r, the sums and the accumulator's lanes it ran through
  the 512-bit registers stay there after the call. r and a tag seen on the
  wire give the pad, and r and the pad forge any message under that key.
  Every tag is still right, so no vector sees it. The script compiles the
  native copy for x86-64 and requires the call in poly1305_ifma_blocks_native.

--- old
    lanes_wipe_registers();
    words_of_totals(p->h, total);
--- new
    words_of_totals(p->h, total);
